  "content": "<p>這是適用於 (Neo)Forge 的沉浸式傳送門模組。<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處為 Fabric 版本</a>。</strong>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>本描述底部有重要注意事項與常見問題解答區段，請務必抽空閱讀。</strong></p><hr><h1>透視傳送門並無縫穿越，無需載入畫面。</h1><p><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2021/05/12/UlJ3zdESNyZWmxG.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h3>其他功能：</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fPortals%2523end-portals\" rel=\"nofollow\">強化終界傳送門</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fPortals%2523mirrors\" rel=\"nofollow\">鏡像</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fPortal-Customization\" rel=\"nofollow\">創建自訂傳送門指令</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fDatapack-Based-Custom-Portal-Generation\" rel=\"nofollow\">基於資料包的自訂傳送門生成</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fPortals%2523world-wrapping-portal\" rel=\"nofollow\">世界環繞</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki%252fDimension-Stack\" rel=\"nofollow\">維度堆疊</a></li>\n<li>詳情請參閱<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqouteall.fun%252fimmptl%252fwiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基百科</a>。</li>\n</ul><hr><h3>依賴項目：</h3><p>本模組的<strong>1.14 和 1.15</strong>版本依賴於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixinbootstrap\" rel=\"nofollow\">MixinBootstrap</a>。</p><p>本模組<strong>1.19 之後的所有版本</strong>均依賴於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>。</p><hr><h3>聯絡方式：</h3><p><a href=\"https://github.com/qouteall/ImmersivePortalsModForForge/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報問題</a></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BZxgURK\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a></p><hr><h3>重要注意事項與常見問題解答：</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>不建議使用 MC 1.16.x 版本，因為該版本已嚴重過時且與 Forge 的動態維度功能不相容。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>新增模組時，務必備份現有世界。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>問</strong>：我遇到此模組的問題，該怎麼辦？<br><strong>答</strong>：請參閱上方的聯絡方式區段，於 GitHub 提交問題報告，和/或在我們的 Discord 伺服器的 #help-forge-version 頻道留言。</li>\n<li><strong>問</strong>：[MC 版本] 何時推出？<br><strong>答</strong>：準備好就會推出！請不要再問了，我知道新 MC 版本何時發布。</li>\n<li><strong>問</strong>：支援哪些 MC 版本？<br><strong>答</strong>：請參閱下方的支援對照表：</li>\n</ul><table style=\"width:97.3881%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<th style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.5676%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.14.4</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.4324%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.15.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.5676%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.16.5</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.4324%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.18.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:12.5676%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.19.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:5.81081%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">1.19.3</th>\n<th style=\"width:5.81081%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">🦊1.20.4</th>\n<th style=\"width:4.72973%;border:1px solid rgb(149, 165, 166)\">🦊1.21.1</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">開發中</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">🚧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">已支援</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">✅</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">&nbsp;✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">僅依要求修復</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">僅接受拉取請求</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">&nbsp;🔀</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">🔀</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-color:#95a5a6\">\n<td style=\"width:22.1622%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">已終止支援</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">⚠️</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">⚠️</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;text-align:center;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">⚠️</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.4324%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:12.5676%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166);text-align:center\">⚠️</td>\n<td style=\"width:5.81081%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:4.72973%;border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(149, 165, 166)\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>注意：</strong></span> 對照表中未